# Desi Jugaad API - Caddy reverse proxy
#
# sslip.io gives a free HTTPS hostname that needs no domain purchase:
#   132-226-212-175.sslip.io  ->  resolves to 132.226.212.175 (this VM)
# Caddy obtains and renews a Let's Encrypt certificate automatically via the
# HTTP-01 challenge, which REQUIRES inbound TCP 80 (plus 443) to be open in
# the Oracle Cloud security list - see deploy/README.md.
#
# The NestJS API itself listens on 127.0.0.1:4000 only and is never
# reachable except through this proxy.

132-226-212-175.sslip.io {
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:4000
}
